moss-layers:
Moss Layers 
 Overview 
 A simple mod that adds moss layers, which can be placed like snow layers. There are 8 moss layers to a block.&nbsp; 
 &nbsp; 

 &nbsp; 
 Crafting Recipe 
 The crafting recipe is 3 moss blocks in a line which yields 24 moss layers.&nbsp; 
 &nbsp; 

 &nbsp; 
 Drops 
 Each moss layer drops itself. No tools or enchantments are required.&nbsp; 
 &nbsp; 

 &nbsp; 
 Credit to our cats Nidalee, Nenya, Nooka, and Meniscus, who made this ten times harder to make but ten times more enjoyable.

