playtime_hud:
Playtime HUD is a server-side Data Pack / Mod that adds a timer that indicates how much time a player spent on the world.






 Functions 

 /function diesse:timer/reset timer : Reset the timer; 
 /trigger pause : Stop the timer; 
 /trigger resume : Resume the timer; 




This mechanic is used in minigames like Bedwars , ManHunt , SkyWars ... 

It can be also used to Speedrun the game and see the timer in the whiletime.

